    "source": "Official pages only: fundingpips.com/2-step-standard, /2-step-pro, /2-step-flex, /zero (prices from each page's pricing table data); help.fundingpips.com articles '2 Step Standard', '2 Step Pro Model', '2 Step Flex', '1 Step Flex', 'FundingPips Zero', 'Get Started' (rules, platforms, restricted countries, fee refund); fundingpips.com footer 'Related Entities' (company details); fundingpips.com/blog/funding-pips-new-chapter (start of operations, November 2022).",
    "pricing": "standard = list price shown on each product page (no crossed-out price was shown on 2026-10-02, so promo is null). A site-wide banner offered code FP: 10% off for new users, 5% off for existing users; the Get Started help article also mentions code HELLO (20% off first purchase, excludes $100K). Codes not applied here. Optional Swap-Free add-on costs +10%.",
    "billing": "One-time challenge fee per account. No monthly subscription or activation fee is mentioned on the official pages. On 2 Step Standard only, the fee is refunded with the 4th reward on the Master Account; this refund does not apply to 1 Step Flex, 2 Step Pro, 2 Step Flex or Zero.",
    "two_step_standard_3pct": "The 3% daily-loss option is priced from the page's data as the 5% price minus a stated dollar difference (-8, -14, -39, -61, -108 for 5K-100K). Only the 5% price for $50K was visible as text; confirm the 3% prices with a screenshot before publishing.",
    "two_step_pro_min_days": "Conflict on official pages: the product page shows 0 minimum trading days per phase, while the help centre says accounts bought on or after 26 August 2026 need 2 minimum trading days. Left null until confirmed.",
    "one_step_flex": "Prices could not be read (page blocked automated access). Daily loss is 2% or 3% depending on the configuration bought, so daily_loss is left null.",
    "zero": "No evaluation. 5% max loss trails the highest equity and locks at the starting balance once the account is 5% up. Also: 1% max open risk, at least 7 profitable days (0.25%+ each) per rolling 30 days, 15% consistency score for rewards.",
    "reward_cycles": "2 Step Standard: Weekly 60%, Bi-Weekly 80%, On Demand 90%, Monthly 100%. 2 Step Pro: Weekly 80%, Monthly 100%. 2 Step Flex: Bi-Weekly 80% or 95% (95% needs 3 profitable days), Monthly 100%. 1 Step Flex: Bi-Weekly 80%, Monthly 100%. Monthly 100% applies to evaluations bought on or after 15 August 2026 and needs a 35% consistency score and 7 profitable days.",
    "restrictions": "FundingPips does not accept residents of the UAE, Iran or Vietnam (help centre 'Get Started' and site footer).",
    "rule_units": "Forex rules are % of account size.",
    "null_means": "Not stated (or stated inconsistently) on the official pages checked. See the notes above before publishing.",
    "unverified_prices": "Standard (3% daily) prices left null: earlier figures ($36/$66/$177/$288/$544) were calculated from a discount in the page data, not shown on the page. Confirm with a screenshot."
